                <p>The only infrastructure engineer at a smart-home IoT company for 4+ years. Own the cloud side end to end (architecture, reliability, cost, security and data) for a platform serving 10,000+ hubs and about 1 million connected devices. Write the protocol and API specs that a core team of about 10 firmware, mobile and backend engineers build against. Took over a manually deployed legacy stack, made it stable with automated, zero-downtime releases, and cut the monthly cloud bill by about 40%.</p>
